  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Alert 973 Sudan (Anticipation of flooding)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Convening agency and its consortium partners, notably PLAN , Convening agency , and Caritas Sudan, ASSISTare delivering a range of humanitarian and development activities across all targeted localities in White Nile State. (Guli Locality, AL-Jabalin Locality, Rabak Locality, ALDeuim Locality, AlSalam Locality, and Tendalti Locality ) These include:_x000d_
WASH: Convening agency is the WASH sector lead for both refugee and IDP camps across white Nile state, co-hosting sector coordination meeting with UNICEF. Interventions cover water supply, sanitation infrastructure, hygiene promotion, and emergency preparedness._x000d_
Multi-Purpose Cash Assistance (MPCA): Ongoing unconditional cash transfers are being implemented in Al Deuim, Al Jabalain, Tendalti, and Kosti by the Convening agency and in Guli and Tendalti by PLAN._x000d_
Protection: Convening agency and its local partners operate protection programming funded by private resources and Global Affairs Canada (GAC) focusing on vulnerable groups across all six targeted localities and camps. Convening agency is working in AlSalam, Guli, AlJabalin, and AlDueim localities funded by the private resources and UNHCR, and UNICEF.</narrative>
  </description>
